{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101714","id":2796211413,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6mqszV","number":101714,"title":"Item Cull Masks for the DirectionalLight2D node do not affect light coverage.","user":{"login":"evlynlangfrd","id":190441870,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1npjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190441870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd","html_url":"https://github.com/evlynlangfrd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evlynlangfrd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-01-17T20:05:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T23:10:35Z","closed_at":"2025-01-17T23:10:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.3.stable.steam [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable (77dcf97d8) - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.2127) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10310U CPU @ 1.70GHz (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a DirectionalLight2D node to illuminate a scene and excluding/including nodes using any of the range options (Layers, Z height, and Item Cull Mask), those options do not affect the illumination of nodes in the scene. This bug does not affect the PointLight2D node, only the directional variant.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d9ee184-9ef4-4803-bf34-2838cabd22bf)\n(The robot should not be affected by the directional light subtraction)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn a 2D scene, add a Sprite2D node with a texture attached. Add a DirectionalLight2D node and set the Item Cull Mask to something different from the sprite's light mask. The DirectionalLight2D node will continue to affect the sprite after changing the cull mask. The same is true for sprites on different layers and z heights.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[directionallightbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18459105/directionallightbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101714/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}